remote-picture-type = ເລືອກຮູບ PNG, JPEG, GIF, WebP ຫຼື SVG.
remote-picture-read-failed = ບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານຮູບໄດ້: { $error }
remote-picture-keep-failed = ບໍ່ສາມາດເກັບຮູບໄວ້ໄດ້: { $error }
